name: sim.setModelProperty
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: sim.setModelProperty(int objectHandle, int prop)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setModelProperty(int objectHandle, int prop)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object that serves as the model base
2. prop: model property. See the model property values. Combine them with the "or"-operator
